    "semantic_summary": "VectorMemoryModule acts as a controlled service layer wrapper for the core VectorMemory system, managing its lifecycle. Its primary role is to defer the instantiation of the heavy VectorMemory object until a valid session context (session_id and BaseModel) is available via the initialize method. It provides guarded access to the underlying instance via get_instance and ensures proper resource cleanup through shutdown, adhering to a service pattern for module registry integration."
